WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
Boris FX Continuum 2027 is here

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.120
There are new effects, and we'll get to them first

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.300
but a lot of this release is about the tools you already use

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.300
doing more

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.140
without extra layers, or leaving your app

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:17.460
Let's start with titles

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:21.300
The new BCC Text is a fast way to build titles and graphics

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:24.480
right on your timeline

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:29.160
Create, animate, and style text down to the individual character

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:34.060
Save your looks to build a consistent house or show style

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:38.360
That same idea carries into procedural design

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.600
BCC+ Noise Map Studio creates an almost

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:44.520
unlimited range of animated textures

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:48.640
Use them as finished graphics elements, turn them into maps

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.160
or feed them into other effects as control maps

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:56.120
One tool becomes a starting point for dozens of different looks

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:59.020
and change things directly in the effects editor
